   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg16"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Quite a few. Many phones have live captions that show what the other person says as text on the screen.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 1.72,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg16"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Really? That would be amazing for him.",
