   "text": "the dog, too.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 1.71,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg16"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then that's a double win. Set up the captions, put a big video call button on his home screen, and do a practice call together.",
